### Đăng ký (Register)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

###

### Đăng nhập (Login)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Lấy thông tin người dùng (Me)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Đăng xuất (Logout)
POST {{host}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
